{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 78,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        246.438720703125,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        527.0250854492188,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "As part of the preparatory process for the GDG meeting in May 2024, WHO commissioned a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.798583984375,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "modelled study to assess the cost–effectiveness of using LC-aNAATs (including Xpert Ultra,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.9232177734375,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Truenat and other novel LC-aNAATs in the development pipeline) for the detection of TB when",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976574897766113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        527.0428466796875,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "used concurrently among people living with HIV and children, including children with HIV,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.565185546875,
        394.1846618652344,
        170.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "across two different country settings (Malawi and the Philippines).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.569091796875,
        526.6917114257812,
        194.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "A study objective was to assess the cost–effectiveness of concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.069091796875,
        527.2453002929688,
        210.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "respiratory and stool samples for TB diagnosis and rifampicin-resistance detection among",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.569091796875,
        526.9149169921875,
        225.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "children (aged <10 years) with presumptive TB and without HIV infection, compared with a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.069091796875,
        302.43487548828125,
        241.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "single LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample alone.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.0731201171875,
        527.1790771484375,
        265.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "In this hypothetical model, a cohort of children with presumptive TB progressed through a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.5731201171875,
        526.98095703125,
        280.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "decision analytical framework. In the intervention arm, TB diagnosis involved the concurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.0731201171875,
        526.9801635742188,
        296.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "use of LC-aNAATs on both respiratory and stool samples, whereas the comparator arm solely",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.5731201171875,
        527.14306640625,
        311.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "used LC-aNAATs on respiratory specimens. The probability of being able to provide a respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951493263244629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.0731201171875,
        527.1898803710938,
        327.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "sample was considered, and testing was conducted, either for both respiratory and stool samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        329.5731201171875,
        526.9677734375,
        342.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "concurrently or solely for stool. In both the intervention and comparator arms, participants not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984088897705078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.0731201171875,
        527.0571899414062,
        358.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed through the diagnostic strategy had the opportunity for clinical diagnosis. Children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991246223449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.5731201171875,
        524.3433227539062,
        373.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "with bacteriologically confirmed TB underwent DST for rifampicin and began either drug-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.0731201171875,
        527.2477416992188,
        389.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "susceptible TB or DR-TB treatment, depending on the DST result. All individuals were followed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997650146484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.5731201171875,
        526.9701538085938,
        404.7181396484375
      ],
      "text": "over time, including those with false negative or false positive diagnostic results, to account",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.0731201171875,
        438.5137023925781,
        420.2181396484375
      ],
      "text": "for unnecessary treatment or additional mortality due to missed diagnoses.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.0769958496094,
        526.581298828125,
        444.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "When using the high TB burden setting of Malawi to parametrize the model, cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964191436767578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.5769958496094,
        526.9590454101562,
        459.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "modelling found that the use of an LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample resulted in an average",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.0769958496094,
        526.6310424804688,
        475.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "cost of US$ 144, with a corresponding average DALY of 0.93. In contrast, the concurrent use of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987592697143555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.5769958496094,
        526.9645385742188,
        490.7220153808594
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAATs on respiratory and stool samples yielded an average cost of US$ 204, and a DALY",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.0769958496094,
        526.9591674804688,
        506.2220153808594
      ],
      "text": "of 0.57, resulting in an incremental cost per DALY averted of US$ 253 (95% UR: 123–2317)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.5770263671875,
        146.68820190429688,
        521.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "( ). Table 2.3.2.1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.5810546875,
        526.9590454101562,
        545.72607421875
      ],
      "text": "Similarly, in the Philippines, the cost of an LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample was US$ 84,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.0810546875,
        526.875,
        561.22607421875
      ],
      "text": "associated with a DALY of 1.04. Concurrent testing in the Philippines resulted in an average cost",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956765174865723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.5810546875,
        526.9656982421875,
        576.72607421875
      ],
      "text": "of US$ 149 and a DALY of 0.66, with an ICER of US$ 156 per DALY averted (95% UR: 79–888)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.0809936523438,
        146.68820190429688,
        592.2260131835938
      ],
      "text": "( ). Table 2.3.2.1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "62 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}